rd mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_d = 15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>good</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{good}} = 8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">good</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span>，则阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mstyle mathcolor=\"#cc0000\"><mtext>\\*</mtext></mstyle></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.33</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^\\* \\approx 0.33</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0824em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">\\*</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.33</span></span></span></span></span>——当该订单被判为欺诈的概率超过约三分之一时就应当暂扣或取消。这个式子的价值在于它把「风险评分」翻译成了钱：评分模型输出的概率可以直接与阈值比较，而不是各人凭感觉定档。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  O[订单创建] --&gt; S[风险打分&lt;br/&gt;速度特征+证据完备度]&#10;  S --&gt;|低风险| F1[直接履约]&#10;  S --&gt;|中风险| H[暂扣&lt;br/&gt;核验买家或供应商]&#10;  S --&gt;|高风险| C1[取消或退款]&#10;  H --&gt;|核验通过| F1&#10;  H --&gt;|核验失败| C1&#10;  F1 --&gt; T[轨迹监控&lt;br/&gt;首扫延迟+无移动窗口]&#10;  T --&gt;|异常| R[供应商质询&lt;br/&gt;赔付或重发]&#10;  T --&gt;|妥投| Z[进入拒付观察窗&lt;br/&gt;120 天]&#10;  Z --&gt;|拒付| D[取证应诉&lt;br/&gt;CE3.0+证据包]\">flowchart TD\n  O[订单创建] --&gt; S[风险打分&lt;br/&gt;速度特征+证据完备度]\n  S --&gt;|低风险| F1[直接履约]\n  S --&gt;|中风险| H[暂扣&lt;br/&gt;核验买家或供应商]\n  S --&gt;|高风险| C1[取消或退款]\n  H --&gt;|核验通过| F1\n  H --&gt;|核验失败| C1\n  F1 --&gt; T[轨迹监控&lt;br/&gt;首扫延迟+无移动窗口]\n  T --&gt;|异常| R[供应商质询&lt;br/&gt;赔付或重发]\n  T --&gt;|妥投| Z[进入拒付观察窗&lt;br/&gt;120 天]\n  Z --&gt;|拒付| D[取证应诉&lt;br/&gt;CE3.0+证据包]</pre><p>落地的三个工程约束容易被低估。第一，<strong>所有判据必须共用同一份事件日志</strong>：轨迹事件、支付验证结果、优惠发放、退货验收以订单为主键关联，否则复用率、速度特征这类跨表指标无从计算。第二，<strong>阈值要按供应商和商品分层</strong>：同样的首扫延迟阈值对国内仓和国际小包并不通用，全局单一阈值必然在某一侧大量误伤。第三，<strong>任何自动取消都要留下可复核的理由码</strong>，误杀正常订单的成本（差评与拒付）不比放过一单欺诈低。风控的目标不是把欺诈降到零，而是持续压低期望损失式的左侧，同时不让右侧的误伤成本失控。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>四类异常——虚假单号、刷单、拒付、薅羊毛——表面上是四种坏人，工程上是同一个问题：某个节点的凭证没有产出、产出了假的、或事后被否认。可运营的做法收敛到三件事：<strong>让每个节点产出可核验凭证</strong>（首扫而非上传单号、妥投而非揽收、AVS/CVV/3DS 而非「已付款」）、<strong>共用一份以订单为主键的事件日志</strong>、<strong>用期望损失阈值代替主观定档</strong>。卡组织侧的比率考核提供外部约束——Visa 与 Mastercard 门槛口径不同、罚款是台阶而非缓坡、亚太 MERP 自 2026 年 10 月起允许追溯拒付——这些决定了风控必须在支付时刻启动。阈值按谁分档见 <a href=\"../dropship-model-supplier-network/supplier-onboarding-capability-model\">供应商准入与能力模型</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"代发欺诈风控与异常行为识别（虚假单号、刷单、拒付与薅羊毛）","id":"代发欺诈风控与异常行为识别-虚假单号-刷单-拒付与薅羊毛"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"四类异常的责任面与损失落点","id":"四类异常的责任面与损失落点"},{"level":2,"text":"虚假单号与轨迹异常：把「已发货」和「已揽收」分开","id":"虚假单号与轨迹异常-把-已发货-和-已揽收-分开"},{"level":2,"text":"拒付与卡组织监控：把个案换算成比率","id":"拒付与卡组织监控-把个案换算成比率"},{"level":2,"text":"拒付发生前：早期预警与事前取证","id":"拒付发生前-早期预警与事前取证"},{"level":2,"text":"卡测与薅羊毛：支付前的速度拦截","id":"卡测与薅羊毛-支付前的速度拦截"},{"level":2,"text":"落成一套可运营的风控状态机","id":"落成一套可运营的风控状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"代发退换货与退款责任归属建模（供应商过错/物流丢失/买家责任分摊）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dropship-supplier-direct-fulfillment-engineering/returns-risk-crossborder-ops/dropship-returns-refund-responsibility"},"next":{"title":"跨境代发税务/清关/受限品合规与运营度量体系（成本、时效、一次解决率）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dropship-supplier-direct-fulfillment-engineering/returns-risk-crossborder-ops/crossborder-ops-metrics-tax-compliance"}}